<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CO" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 JO KORINT</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga mukwongo ma Paulo ocoyo pa Jo Korint</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Jo Korint</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Kor</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga mukwongo ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">JO KORINT</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga ma Paulo ocoyo mukwongo bot jo Korint kicoyo kun lube ki lok me cobo peko ma mako lok me kwo pa lukricitayo ki kit ma niye myero oile kwede malo matek i kanica ma Paulo ocako i Korint. Ikare meno Korint onongo obedo taun madit ma opong ki kaka pa jo Grik, ma bene en aye onongo taun madit ma kom ker pa jo Roma tye iye ite adwol pa Akaia. Taun madit man onongo bene obedo kama biacara time iye matek adada, ma opong ki tekwaro me awaka, kwele ki tim abor madongo ki kwa dini mapatpat.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok ma pire tek mada ma ogudu cwiny lakwena man aye obedo lok mamako apokapoka ikin dano, ki lok me tim abor i kanica, lok mamako butu ikin laco ki dako ki lok me nyom, lok mamako kit yo me tam me cwiny pa dano, kit ma omyero lega owot kede i kanica, ki lok mamako mic pa Cwiny Maleng ki cer ikin jo ma oto. Ki niang matut, Paulo onyutu kit ma Kwena Maber kelo kwede ngec wa ki lagam ikom lapeny magi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Cura 13, nyutu mar macalo mic madit maloyo ducu ikin mic pa Lubanga bot danone. Ginacoya ma i cura man aye ginacoya ma ngene matek maloyo ki i buk man.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Lanyut <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 1:1-9">1:1-9</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Tic matye i kanica <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 1:10-4:21">1:10—4:21</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yo mupore me butu ikin laco ki dako ki kwo me i ot <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 5:1-7:40">5:1—7:40</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lukricitayo ki jo ma pe guye <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 8:1-11:1">8:1—11:1</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwo me kanica ki miyo deyo ki woro bot Rwot <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 11:2-14:40">11:2—14:40</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cer pa Kricito ki pa jo ma oye <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 15:1-58">15:1-58</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Gityer pa Lukricitayo matye i Judaya <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">16:1-4</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok ma mako kom Paulo ki ladol lok <char style="ior"><ref loc="1CO 16:5-24">16:5-24</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 1:1" />Waraga man oa ki bot Paulo, ma pi mit pa Lubanga yam Lubanga olwongo me bedo lakwena pa Kricito Yecu, ki bot ominwa Coctene.<verse eid="1CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:1">Tic 18:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Bot jo ma oye Lubanga ma gitye i Korint, ma gin jo ma kilonyogi gudoko maleng i Kricito Yecu, ma Lubanga olwongogi me bedo jone kikome, kacel ki jo ducu ma gitye ikabedo ducu, ma gilwongo nying Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, Rwotgi ki mewa bene: <verse eid="1CO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 1:3" />Lubanga Wonwa ki Rwotwa Yecu Kricito omiwu kica ki kuc.<verse eid="1CO 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gum manonge i Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 1:4" />Nino ducu amiyo pwoc bot Lubangana pi kicane ma en omiyowu i Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="1CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 1:5" />Pien pi ribewu ki Kricito omiyo dong wudoko lulonyo i yo ducu. Wutye bene dong ki ngec ducu, dok wutwero dong lok maber. <verse eid="1CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 1:6" />Pien lok ma wabedo ka titone ikom Yecu Kricito odonyo matek i iwu. <verse eid="1CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 1:7" />Omiyo mot mo me cwiny pe orem botwu, ma kun pud wutye ka kuru kare me nyutu Rwotwa Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 1:8" />En bigwokowu miyo wubicung matek nio wa i agiki, wek pe wubed tye ki gin mo ma omyero kidotwu iye inino pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 1:9" />Lubanga ma olwongowu me ribe kacel ki Wode Yecu Kricito Rwotwa, en ngat ma gene.<verse eid="1CO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apokapoka i Kanica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 1:10" />Abako doga botwu, wutmegina, pi nying Rwotwa Yecu Kricito, ni wun ducu omyero wulok lok acel, apokapoka mo pe myero obed tye ikinwu, ento omyero wuribe i cwiny ki tam acel. <verse eid="1CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 1:11" />Pien jo mogo ma gua ki bot Koloe gutita lok ikomwu, ni meno daa tye ikinwu, wutmegina. <verse eid="1CO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 1:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24">Tic 18:24</ref></char></note> Gin ma awaco en aye ni, dano acel acel ikinwu tye ka waco ni, “An dano pa Paulo,” onyo ni “An dano pa Kepa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">1:12</char> <char style="fk">Kepa </char> aye nying Petero i leb Aram. </note>,” onyo ni “An dano pa Apolo,” onyo ni “An dano pa Kricito.” <verse eid="1CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 1:13" />Kricito mono iye opoke? Yam mono kiguro Paulo aye ikom yatariya pirwa? Onongo yam kibatijawu inying Paulo? <verse eid="1CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 1:14" />Apwoyo Lubanga mada pien an gira yam pe abatija dano mo ikinwu, kono abatija Kricipo ki Gayo keken, <verse eid="1CO 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:8">Tic 18:8</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Tic 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref></char></note> wek ngat mo pe owac ni kibatija en i nyinga. <verse eid="1CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 16:15">1 Kor 16:15</ref></char></note> (Abatija bene jo ma i ot pa Citepana; pe dong atwero po ka onongo dok abatija ngat mukene.) <verse eid="1CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 1:17" />Kricito pe ocwala ka batija dano, ento katito lok me Kwena Maber ma pe atito ki ryeko mo me lok, wek pe omii to pa Kricito ikom yatariya obed gin ma konye peke.<verse eid="1CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kricito en tek ki ryeko pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 1:18" />Jo matye ka rwenyo gitamoni lok ikom to pa Kricito ikom yatariya, nen calo gin me mingo, ento ki tung botwa, wan jo ma Lubanga tye ka larowa, obedo tek pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:14">Ica 29:14</ref></char></note> Pien yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">“Abityeko ryeko pa jo maryek,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 1:19">abibalo niang pa jo ma ngeyo piny woko.”<verse eid="1CO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 1:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOB 12:17">Yub 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:12">Ica 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 33:18">33:18</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 44:25">Ica 44:25</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jo maryek tye kwene? Lupwonycik kono tye kwene? Lupyem me kare man tye kwene? Lubanga oloko ryeko me lobo man odoko me mingo! <verse eid="1CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 1:21" />Pien Lubanga i ryekone pe omiyo jo me lobo gungeye pi ryekogi, ento Lubanga pi twerone olaro jo ma oye en pi lok me kwena ma kineno calo lok me mingo ma watitoni. <verse eid="1CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 1:22" />Lujudaya gimito neno lanyut mogo, ki jo Grik giyenyo meggi ryeko; <verse eid="1CO 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 1:23" />ento wan giwa watito pi Kricito mayam kiguro ikom yatariya, ma loke ki tung bot Lujudaya nen calo lok atata, ki bot Lurok nen calo lok me mingo. <verse eid="1CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 1:24" />Ento bot jo ma Lubanga olwongogi, Lujudaya ki jo Grik, Kricito obedo tek ki ryeko pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 1:25" />Pien gin manen calo mingo pa Lubanga ryek kato ryeko pa dano woko, ki gin manen calo goro pa Lubanga bene tek kato teko ma dano tye kwede woko.<verse eid="1CO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 1:26" />Utmegina, kong wutam pi lwongo ma Lubanga olwongowu kwede. Jo mapol ikinwu onongo pe giryek ikit me lobo, dok jo mapol ikinwu onongo pe gubedo wegi deyo, jo mapol ikinwu onongo pe gitye ki woro me anywali. <verse eid="1CO 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 1:27" />Ento Lubanga oyero gin ma maming me loboni, wek oket lewic ikom luryeko. Lubanga oyero gin ma goro i loboni wek oket lewic ikom gin jo matek. <verse eid="1CO 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 1:28" />Lubanga oyero gin mogo me lobo ma kicayogi, ma rwomgi piny, kadi jami mogo ma kineno ni konye peke, wek omii gin ma kinenoni konye tye odok gin atata, <verse eid="1CO 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 1:29" />wek dano mo pe owake inyim Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 1:30" />Lubanga aye ma omiyo wubedo i Kricito Yecu, ma Lubanga omiyo odoko ryekowa. Pi Kricito bene omiyo Lubanga okwanowa ni kitwa atir, olonyowa wadoko jo maleng, okokowa bene ki i opii me bal. <verse eid="1CO 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 1:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Jer 9:24</ref></char></note> Dong kit macalo yam kicoyo ni, “Ngat ma nyate myero onyate pi Rwot.”<verse eid="1CO 1:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kwena mamako Kricito ma kiguro ikom yatariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 2:1" />Utmegina, yam pe abino botwu ki lok mo nyo ki ryeko mo mamalo ikare ma akelo botwu kwena me mung me yub pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 2:2" />Onongo amoko tama pe me ngeyo gin mo ikinwu, kono Yecu Kricito keken, ki kit ma gigure kwede ikom yatariya. <verse eid="1CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:9">Tic 18:9</ref></char></note> Yam abedo kwedwu ma agoro, abedo ki lworo madwong, koma bene omyel matek. <verse eid="1CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 2:4" />Loka ki gin ma atito yam pe obedo lok mo me ryeko me ywayo tamwu, ento onyutu tek pa Cwiny Maleng, <verse eid="1CO 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 2:5" />wek niyewu pe ocung ikom ryeko pa dano, ento ikom tek pa Lubanga.<verse eid="1CO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ryeko ma a ki bot Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 2:6" />Watito ryeko bot jo muteggi, ento ryeko man pe ryeko me loboni, nyo ryeko pa luloc me kare man, ma twerogi rwenyo wokoni. <verse eid="1CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 2:7" />Ento wan watito ryeko pa Lubanga ma en mung ma kikano, ryeko mayam Lubanga oyubu wa con me kelo deyo botwa. <verse eid="1CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 2:8" />Pe tye laloc mo me lobo man ma oniang iye; ka onongo nene guniang, kono pe guguro Rwot, won deyo ikom yatariya. <verse eid="1CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:4">Ica 64:4</ref></char></note> Ento kit macalo yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">“Gin mogo ma dano pe guneno ki wanggi dok bene pe guwinyo ki itgi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">gin mogo ma pe donyo itam pa dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:9">gin magi en aye gin ma Lubanga oyubu pi jo ma mare.”<verse eid="1CO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 2:10" />Dok bene meno aye gin ma Lubanga omiyo Cwiny Maleng onyutugi botwa. Pien Cwiny Maleng ngiyo jami ducu, dok bene en ngeyo kadi wa lok ducu ma niange tek ikom Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 2:11" />Anga ma ngeyo tam matye i dano mukene? Pe cwiny danoni matye i iye keken aye ngeyo? Kitmeno bene, pe tye ngat mo ma ngeyo tam pa Lubanga, kono Cwiny pa Lubanga keken. <verse eid="1CO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 2:12" />Yam pe kimiyowa ryeko me lobo man, ento kimiyowa Cwiny ma oa ki bot Lubanga, wek omii waniang ikom kit mot ducu ma Lubanga miyowa pi kicane. <verse eid="1CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 2:13" />Meno aye lok ma watito; pe waloko lok ma kipwonyo ki ryeko pa dano, ento watito lok ma Cwiny Maleng opwonyowa kwede, kun wagonyo telok me Cwiny bot jo matye ki Cwiny pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 2:14" />Ento dano ma pe ki Cwiny pa Lubanga pe twero gamo gin ma Cwiny pa Lubanga miyo, pien ki tung bote nen calo gin me mingo, en pe twero niang iye, pien gin macalo meno Cwiny Maleng aye miyo dano ngeyo poko. <verse eid="1CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 2:15" />Dano matye ki Cwiny pa Lubanga ngeyo poko kin jami ducu, ento ngat mo pe matwero ngolo kop ikome. <verse eid="1CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Ica 40:13</ref></char></note> Yam kicoyo ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">“Anga ma ngeyo tam pa Rwot?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 2:16">Anga mayam miye tam?”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CO 2:16">Ento wan watye ki tam pa Kricito.<verse eid="1CO 2:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lutic pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 3:1" />Ento wun wutmegina, yam pe onongo atwero lok kwedwu calo jo matye ki Cwiny pa Lubanga, ento aloko kwedwu macalo jo ma pud tye ki kit me kom ma kinywalowu kwede, macalo lutino lukere i Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 5:12">Ibru 5:12</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 5:13">13</ref></char></note> Yam apitowu ki cak, pien onongo peya wutwero camo kwon kikome; kadi wa kombedi bene pud pe wuromo camo kwon kikome, <verse eid="1CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 3:3" />pien pud wutye ki kit me kom ma kinywalowu kwede. Ka pud wutye ki nyeko ikinwu, ma wuda kekenwu, meno pe nyutu ni pud wutye ikit me kom ma kinywalowu kwede, kun pud wulubu kit pa dano? <verse eid="1CO 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 1:12">1 Kor 1:12</ref></char></note>Ka dano mo ikinwu waco ni, “An dano pa Paulo,” ki ngat mukene bene waco ni, “An dano pa Apolo,” meno nongo pe nyutu ni wun pud wubedo dano adana?<verse eid="1CO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 3:5" />Apolo mono en anga? Paulo kono en anga? Wan mere wabedo lutic mamiyo wuye Yecu. Ngat acel acel tye ki tic ma Rwot opoko bote. <verse eid="1CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:4-11">Tic 18:4-11</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:24-28">Tic 18:24-28</ref></char></note> Yam acoyo kodi, Apolo oonyo iye pii, ento Lubanga omiyo odongo. <verse eid="1CO 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 3:7" />Kadi bed kumeno, ngat ma ocoyo kodi nyo ngat ma oonyo iye pii, gin ducu pirgi pe dito, kono Lubanga keken aye myero pire obed dit pien en aye mamiyo jami dongo. <verse eid="1CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 3:8" />Dano ma ocoyo kodi ki ngat ma oonyo pii iye, gin ducu girom, ngat acel acel binongo mucarane muporo tic ma en otiyo. <verse eid="1CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 3:9" />Pien wan lutic kacel ki Lubanga; wun poto pa Lubanga, dok bene wun gedo pa Lubanga.<verse eid="1CO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 3:10" />Pi kica pa Lubanga ma kimiya, omiyo aketo teguti me gedo macalo ladit me gedo ma ladiru; ki dano mo mukene tye ka gero ot iwiye. Ento dano acel acel myero ogwoke mada pi kit gedo ango ma etye ka gedone. <verse eid="1CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 3:11" />Pien pe tye teguti mo mukene doki ma kitwero ketone, kono maca madong tyeni keken, en aye Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 3:12" />Dong ka ngat mo ogedo iwi teguti mukwongonu ki jabu nyo ryal, nyo godi me wel gu, nyo yat nyo lum, nyo reng kal, <verse eid="1CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 3:13" />tic ma dano acel acel otiyo binen woko kamaleng. Pien mac me Nino maca binyutu tic pa dano acel acel, ci nyutu kamaleng kit macalo tice tye kwede. <verse eid="1CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 3:14" />Kace inen gedo pa danoni odong, en gedo ma ogero ikom teguti mukwongoni, dano meno bilimo mic me pwoc. <verse eid="1CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 3:15" />Ento kace gedo pa dano mo owang woko, ci en pe binongo mic mo me pwoc, ento en kikome bibwot, macalo ngat madong oloyo cwicwi ki i mac ka dong okati kamaleng.<verse eid="1CO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 3:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:19">1 Kor 6:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Kor 6:16</ref></char>
    </note> Pe wungeyo ni wun aye wubedo Ot pa Lubanga me woro en, dok Cwiny pa Lubanga bedo i iwu? <verse eid="1CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 3:17" />Dong ka ngat mo obalo Ot pa Lubanga, Lubanga bene bityeke woko; pien Ot pa Lubanga leng, wun ki komwu aye wuot meno.<verse eid="1CO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 3:18" />Ngat mo pe obwole kekene. Kace dano mo ikinwu tamo ni eryek ikit ma lobo neno kwede, en kong omyero oloke odok laming, ka wek dong odok maryek. <verse eid="1CO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 5:13">Yub 5:13</ref></char></note> Pien gin ma dano me lobo man gitamo ni obedo me ryeko, inyim Lubanga obedo gin me mingo. Pien yam kicoyo ni, “En mako jo maryek iryekogi ken gi, macalo i owic,” <verse eid="1CO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 94:11">Jab 94:11</ref></char></note>dok ni, “Rwot ngeyo ni tam pa luryeko mere gin ma konye peke.” <verse eid="1CO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 3:21" />Pimeno ngat mo pe myero owake ikom ngat mo, pien jami ducu obedo mewu. <verse eid="1CO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 3:22" />Kadi wa Paulo, nyo Apolo, nyo Kepa, nyo lobo man, nyo kwo, nyo to, nyo gin matye kombedi, nyo gin ma bibedo tye i anyim, magi gu ducu mewu. <verse eid="1CO 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 3:23" />Wun jo pa Kricito, ki Kricito pa Lubanga.<verse eid="1CO 3:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Lukwena pa Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 4:1" />Omyero kinenwa macalo lutic pa Kricito, ki lugwok mung pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 4:2" />Gin mamite ki bot lugwok jami, en aye ni omyero gubed jo ma gene. <verse eid="1CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 4:3" />Ki tung bota an pe aparo kace wun onyo otkot ongolo kop ikoma, ni atiyo tica i yo mupore onyo pe. An ki koma bene pe angolo kop ikoma kena. <verse eid="1CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 4:4" />Pien angeyo ni cwinya leng, ento man pe nyutuni an apeke ki bal. Rwot aye ma ngolo kop ikoma. <verse eid="1CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 4:5" />Pimeno, pe wungol kop mo ma peya kare oromo, ma pud peya Rwot odwogo. En aye ma bimenyo gin ducu mukane i piny macol, dok binyutu tam matye i cwiny dano wek onen woko ducu kamaleng. Ikare meno Lubanga bipwoyo dano acel acel ikit ma myero.<verse eid="1CO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 4:6" />Utmegina, lok magi aloko kun odok ikoma ki ikom Apolo pirwu, wek omii wadok lanyut botwu kun wupwonye ikomwa ki telok man ni, “Wubed kun wulubu gin mayam kicoyo.” Wek dano mo ikinwu pe owake, ma pako dano acel kun cayo kwede ngat mukene. <verse eid="1CO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 4:7" />Dong anga mono ma oketo in dit makato jo mukeneni woko? Gin ango ma itye kwede ma pe kimiyo ki in amiya? Ka kimiyo ki in amiya, ci pingo iwake kwede kumeno calo pe kimii amiya nono?<verse eid="1CO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 4:8" />Dong wutye ki gin ducu ma wumito? Dong wudoko lulonyo bene? Dong bene wudoko luker, kadi bed wan pe luker! Atikane kono onongo wamito ni wudok luker gire, wek wan bene wabed luker kacel kwedwu. <verse eid="1CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 4:9" />Pien atamo ni, nen calo Lubanga onyutuwa wan lukwena calo jo mudong cen tutwal, macalo jo ma kingolo kop me to iwigi; pien dong wadoko ginanena pi jo matye iwi lobo ducu, bot lumalaika ki bot dano. <verse eid="1CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 4:10" />Dong wadoko luming pi Kricito, ento wun wuryek i Kricito. Wan wagoro, ento wun wutek. Kiketo deyo ikomwu, ento wan kicayowa acaya. <verse eid="1CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 4:11" />Nio kombedi wan wabedo kec, orwo pii oketowa woko, bongo me arukawa peke, kigoyowa, ki pacowagu bene peke. <verse eid="1CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">Tic 18:3</ref></char></note> Wacane kun watiyo tic matek ki cingwa. Ka dano giyetowa, wan walamo gum ikomgi; ka giunowa, wan waciro acira; <verse eid="1CO 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 4:13" />ka gibalo nyingwa, wan wanwere giwa anwera ki mwolo. Dong wadoko calo yugi me wi lobo; wan dong cete me jami ducu.<verse eid="1CO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 4:14" />Pe acoyo lok man ni wek lewic omakwu, ento me pwonyowu macalo lutinona ma amaro. <verse eid="1CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 4:15" />Kadi bed wutye ki lupwony alip ki alip ma gitelowu i yo pa Kricito, pe wutye ki wego mapol. Yam adoko wonwu i Kricito pi lok me Kwena Maber. <verse eid="1CO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:1">1 Kor 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Pili 3:17</ref></char></note> Pimeno alegowu, wulub kita. <verse eid="1CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 4:17" />Man en gin ma omiyo acwalo Temceo botwu. Temceo aye latina ma amaro i Rwot, dok gene. En bipoyo wiwu i yo ma atye kalubune i Kricito Yecu, ma apwonyo ki jo ducu muye Kricito ikabedo ducu. <verse eid="1CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 4:18" />Jo mogo ikinwu gitye ka tamo ni an pe abibino botwu, omiyo gitye ka wake. <verse eid="1CO 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 4:19" />Ento ka Rwot oye ci abio botwu oyot, ento pe abiketo cwinya ilok ma giloko aloka ma gitye ka wake kwedeni, ento wek abinen ka gitye ki tek pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 4:20" />Ker pa Lubanga pe ocung ikom gin ma kiloko aloka ento ocung ikom tek. <verse eid="1CO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 4:21" />Wumito gin ango? Wumito abin botwu ki odo, nyo abin ki mar ki cwiny me mwolo?<verse eid="1CO 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tim kwele i Kanica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 22:30">Nwo 22:30</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Atye kawinyo lok ni tim mo me kwele kwele tye ikinwu. Lakit kwele meno pe nen wa ikin jo ma pe ngeyo Lubanga. Ni tye dano mo ikinwu ma okwayo ciwone ci tye kabutu kwede macalo dakone. <verse eid="1CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 5:2" />Pud bene wuwake pire? Cwinywu pe myero ocwer wek kiryem ngat ma otimo lakit tim macalo meno woko ki ikinwu?<verse eid="1CO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 5:3" />An ki tung bota, kadi apeke kunu, ento cwinya tye botwu kunu; piman dong atyeko ngolo kop ikom dano meno madong otimo tim marac kit man ni woko. <verse eid="1CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 5:4" />Ka wucoke ma an atye kwedwu i cwiny ki teko pa Rwotwa Yecu, <verse eid="1CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 5:5" />ci wumii dano macalo man bot Catan wek onek kome woko, wek kilar cwinye aye inino pa Rwot. <verse eid="1CO 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 5:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 5:9">Gal 5:9</ref></char></note> Wakewuni pe ber. Pe wungeyo ni tobi matidi mo yenyo moko ducu ma kirubu me tedo mugati? <verse eid="1CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 5:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:5">Nia 12:5</ref></char></note> Wukwany tobi macon me bal woko, wek wubed calo ngano ma kinywango manyen. I adane, tobi pe ikomwu, pien latin romowa me Karama me Kato dong kityero woko, en aye Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 5:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:7">Nia 13:7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:3">Nwo 16:3</ref></char></note> Pe dong myero wakweru Karama me Kato ki tobi macon, en tobi me raccwiny ki tim mogo maracu, ento myero wakweru ki Mugati ma Tobi pe iye, ma en aye leng ic ki ada.<verse eid="1CO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 5:9" />Yam acoyo botwu i waragana ni meno, pe wuribe ki jo ma gitimo tim kwele. <verse eid="1CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 5:10" />Pe onongo aloko ikom dano me loboni ma gitimo tim kwele, nyo luworo me jami, ki luyak, nyo jo ma woro cal jogi. Pe kumeno; ka kuman onongo myero wua woko ki i lobo. <verse eid="1CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 5:11" />I adane acoyo botwu ni pe wuribe ki ngat mo ma kilwongo ni dano pa Kricito, katimo tim kwele, nyo ka en obedo laworo me jami, nyo obedo dano ma woro cal jok, gwok nyo layet dano, lamero nyo layak; pe wunywak cam kacel ki lakodi danoni. <verse eid="1CO 5:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="1CO 5:12-13" />Meno pe tica me ngolo kop ikom jo ma pe guye Yecu. Lubanga aye ma bingolo kop ikomgi. Pe myero wun aye wungol kop ikom jo ma oye Lubanga ma gitye ikinwu? <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12-13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:5">Nwo 13:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:7">17:7</ref></char></note> Kit macalo kicoyo ni, “Wuryem dano marac woko ki ikinwu.”<verse eid="1CO 5:12-13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CO 6" />
  <para style="s1">Pido ikin jo ma guye Yecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 6:1" />Ka dano mo ikinwu tye ki lok mo ikom lawote, pingo lewic pe make me cito ka pido ki danoni inyim jo ma pe guye Kricito, ma ka pido kwede inyim jo pa Lubanga? <verse eid="1CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 6:2" />Pe wungeyo ni jo pa Lubanga aye ma bingolo kop ikom dano me lobo? Ka wun kulu aye ma wubingolo kop ikom lobo, ci pe wuromo ngolo kop mogo matitinone pirwu kenwu? <verse eid="1CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 6:3" />Pe wungeyo bene ni wan aye ma wabingolo kop ikom lumalaika? Ento kop ma mako kwo ma watye iyeni kono? <verse eid="1CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 6:4" />Kace wutye ki lok mogo me alara ikinwu, pingo wutero inyim jo ma pe guye Kricito? <verse eid="1CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 6:5" />Awaco lok man wek lewic omakwu. Pe tye ngat mo maryek ikinwu maromo tyeko lok matye ikin utmege? <verse eid="1CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 6:6" />Ma ka timo kitmeno, nen, dano moni dok pido ki lawote wa inyim jo ma pe guye Kricito.<verse eid="1CO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 6:7" />Ka wupido pido ikomwu kekenwu kitmeno, nongo pe dong kiloyowu woko? Pingo pe ber botwu me ciro gin marac? Bedo ber ka kono wuweko dano gubuyowu. <verse eid="1CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 6:8" />Ma ka timo kitmeno, wun ki komwu aye dok wuloke wudok katimo dano marac, dok bene wubuyu kadi wa utmegiwu.<verse eid="1CO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 6:9" />Pe wungeyo ni jo ma pe guye Kricito, ker pa Lubanga pe bibedo megi? Pe wuwek kibwolwu; kadi lutim tim kwele, nyo jo ma woro cal jogi, ki lutim abor, nyo jo ma butu ki co wadgi, <verse eid="1CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 6:10" />nyo lukwo, nyo luworo me jami, nyo lumero, nyo luyet dano, nyo luyak, ker pa Lubanga pe bibedo meggi. <verse eid="1CO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 6:11" />Jo mogo ikinwu bene yam gubedo macalo jo meno. Ento wun dong kityeko lonyowu me bedo jo maleng, kityeko kwanowu ni wun jo ma kitwu atir pi nying Rwot Yecu Kricito ki pi Cwiny pa Lubangawa.<verse eid="1CO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wutii ki komwu me keto deyo ikom Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 10:23">1 Kor 10:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ngat mo biwaco ni, “Kiyena timo jami ducu.” Ento meno pe nyutu ni jami ducu tye ki kony. “Kiyena timo jami ducu,” ento pe abiye ni gin mo oloka adok opiine. <verse eid="1CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 6:13" />Wuwaci, “Cam tye pi ic, ki ic bene pi cam.” Ento gin aryonu ducu Lubanga bityekogi woko. Kom pe tye pi tim kwele, ento tye pi Rwot, Rwot bene tye pi kom. <verse eid="1CO 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 6:14" />Lubanga yam ocero Rwot woko ki ikin jo ma oto, en bicerowa woko bene pi twerone. <verse eid="1CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 6:15" />Pe wungeyo ni komwu aye obedo dul kom Kricito? Mono tye myero ka akwanyo dul kom Kricito, ci aloko odoko dul kom malaya? Pe twere! <verse eid="1CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Aca 2:24</ref></char></note> Pe wungeyo ni dano ma ribe ki malaya doko kom acel kwede? Pien kit macalo yam kicoyo ni “Gin aryonu gibidoko kom acel,” <verse eid="1CO 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 6:17" />Ento ngat ma ribe ki Rwot, doko cwiny acel kwede. <verse eid="1CO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 6:18" />Wubol tim kwele woko. Bal mukene ducu ma dano timo tye woko, pe gudo kome; ento ngat ma timo tim kwele balo kome kekene. <verse eid="1CO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 6:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 3:16">1 Kor 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 6:16">2 Kor 6:16</ref></char></note> Pe wungeyo ni komwu aye ot pa Cwiny Maleng mabedo i iwu, ma Lubanga omiyo botwu? Wun pe wutye pirwu kenwu. <verse eid="1CO 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 6:20" />Dong kiwilowu awila ki wel, pimeno omyero wutii ki komwu me keto deyo ikom Lubanga.<verse eid="1CO 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CO 7" />
  <para style="s1">Lok ikom nyom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 7:1" />Dong me dok i lok ma wucoyo waraga bota pire, bedo ber ka laco mo pe onyomo dako, <verse eid="1CO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 7:2" />ento pi gengo tim me abor, omyero laco acel acel obed ki dakone, ki dako acel acel bene omyero obed ki cware. <verse eid="1CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 7:3" />Laco omyero ocob miti pa dakone, ki dako bene omyero ocob miti pa cware. <verse eid="1CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 7:4" />Dako pe loyo kome kene, ento kono cware aye maloyo; kitmeno laco bene pe loyo kome kene ento dakone bene aye maloyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 7:5" />Dano acel acel pe myero okwer pi kome bot lawote, kono gwok nyo pi kare manok mo keken ma wuyubu ayuba dok wuye kacel, wek wunong kare me bedo kalego Lubanga. Ka lacen dok wuribe kacel, wek Catan pe obitwu, pi miti ma wutye kwede ma pe juke. <verse eid="1CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 7:6" />Awaco lok man macalo tam amiya keken, ento pe aketo macalo cik. <verse eid="1CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 7:7" />Kono onongo twere imitina, kono dano ducu gubed kit macalo atye kwedeni; ento dano acel acel tye ki kit mote mutiko en, ma Lubanga omiye; inongo ni dano moni tye ki mot man, ki dano mukene tye ki mapate.<verse eid="1CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 7:8" />Bot jo ma pud peya gunyomo, ki bot mon ma coggi oto, awaco kit man ni, bedo ber ka onongo gubedo macalo an. <verse eid="1CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 7:9" />Ento ka pe giromo juke ken gi myero gunyom, pien nyom ber kato ma laco nyo dako obedo ka ciro miti me kom.<verse eid="1CO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 7:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:9">19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Mar 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16:18</ref></char>
    </note> Bot jo madong gunyome, acikogi ni dako pe okwer cware, ento man pe an aye ma aciko, Rwot gire aye ma ociko. <verse eid="1CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 7:11" />Ento kace dako mo dong oweko cware, myero obed kene, nyo odwog cen bot cware, pe oger laco mo mukene. Dok laco bene pe myero oket keny ikin gin ki dakone.<verse eid="1CO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 7:12" />Bot jo mukene gu, an ki koma aye ma atye kalok, pe Rwot gire, ni, kace Lakricitayo mo tye ki dakone ma pe oye Yecu, ka dakonu oye me mede ki bedo kwede, laco pe myero oket keny ikin gi woko. <verse eid="1CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 7:13" />Ka dako mo bene tye ki cware ma pe oye Yecu, kace cware oye me mede ki bedo kwede, pe myero okwere. <verse eid="1CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 7:14" />Pien laco ma pe oye Yecu doko leng pi dakone, ki dako ma pe oye Yecu bene doko leng pi cware ma Lakricitayo ni. Ka pe kumeno, kono lutinowu pe gibedo leng, ento kit macalo tye, gileng gigi. <verse eid="1CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 7:15" />Ento ka ngat ma pe oye Yecu mito poke woko ki lawote, wek opoke. Dong lok macalo meno Lakricitayo ma laco nyo ma dako pe tye iye ki dic mo, pien Lubanga olwongowa ni wabed ki kuc. <verse eid="1CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 7:16" />In dako, ingeyo ningning ka ibilaro cwari? Nyo in laco, ingeyo ningning ka ibilaro dakoni?<verse eid="1CO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lub kit kwo ma Rwot omiini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 7:17" />Myero dong dano acel acel olub kit kwo ma Rwot omiye, en kwo mayam en tye iye ikare ma Lubanga olwonge. Man engin ma aciko ki jo ducu ma guye Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 7:18" />Tye dano mo ma onongo dong olire ikare ma kilwonge? En pe myero openy yo me dwoko kome macalo dano ma pe kiliro. Tye dano ma onongo peya kilire ikare ma kilwonge? En pe myero openy yo me lire. <verse eid="1CO 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 7:19" />Pien bedo ma kiliri ki bedo ma pe kiliri pe konyo gin mo; ento gwoko cik pa Lubanga aye konyo. <verse eid="1CO 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 7:20" />Dano acel acel myero obed ki kit ma onongo en tye kwede ikare ma kilwonge. <verse eid="1CO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 7:21" />Ikare ma kilwongi onongo ibedo opii? Pe ipar. Ento ka inongo yo me a woko ki i opii, ci ti kwede. <verse eid="1CO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 7:22" />Ngat ma kilwongo me bedo i Kricito ma onongo en opii, en aye dano ma Rwot dong ogonyo woko ki i opii. Kitmeno bene, ngat ma onongo lone kene ka kilwonge, dong odoko opii pa Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 7:23" />Wun jo ma kiwilo ki wel; pe wudok opii pa dano mo. <verse eid="1CO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 7:24" />Utmegina, dano acel acel myero obed inyim Lubanga kit ma ceng kilwonge kwede ca.<verse eid="1CO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jo ma peya gunyome ki mon ma coggi oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 7:25" />Lok ma dok ikom jo ma pud peya gunyome, pe anongo cik mo ma oa ki bot Rwot, ento amiyo tama iye macalo dano ma Lubanga dong otyeko timo kica bote, en ma omiyo abedo ngat ma gene. <verse eid="1CO 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 7:26" />Dong atamo ni, pi peko matye kabino anyim maraci, bedo ber ka dano moni obedo kit macalo tye kwede. <verse eid="1CO 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 7:27" />Itye ki dako? Pe item gonyo nyom woko. In pe inyomo? Pe imit nyom. <verse eid="1CO 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 7:28" />Ento ka inyomo, nongo pe itimo bal mo. Nyako bene ka kinyomo nongo pe otimo bal. Ento jo ma nyome gibinongo ayelayela me kwo me lobo man; amito ni ka twere kono akwanyo ayelayela meno woko ki ikomwu. <verse eid="1CO 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 7:29" />Utmegina, gin ma aloko en ene ni, kare dong odoko ding; cake kombedi jo matye ki mon myero gubed calo jo ma pe ki mon, <verse eid="1CO 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 7:30" />ki jo ma kumu myero gubed calo jo ma pe kumu, jo ma cwinygi yom calo jo ma pe cwinygi yom, jo ma wilo jami gubed calo jo ma pe tye ki gin mo, <verse eid="1CO 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 7:31" />jo ma tiyo ki jami me lobo man calo jo ma pe gitye katic kwede, pien lobo kit matye kwedeni bitum woko.<verse eid="1CO 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 7:32" />Amito wubed labongo par mo. Laco ma pud peya onyomo, cwinye paro lok pa Rwot, kit ma myero eyom kwede cwiny Rwot. <verse eid="1CO 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 7:33" />Ento laco madong onyomo, paro mere lok me lobo kit ma ebiyomo kwede cwiny dakone; <verse eid="1CO 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 7:34" />tame poke i dul aryo. Dako ma pe kinyomo, nyo nyako, bene paro lok pa Rwot, wek ebed maleng ikome ki i cwinye. Ento dako ma kinyomo paro mere lok me lobo, kit ma myero eyom kwede cwiny cware. <verse eid="1CO 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 7:35" />Awaco lok man pi konyowu, pe me gengowu agenga, ento wek omii gin ducu owot kakare, cwinywu bene obed ikom Rwot, ma gin mo pe ywayo tamwu tero woko cen.<verse eid="1CO 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 7:36" />Ka laco mo tamo ni kit bedone ki nyako ma etongo keny woko ikome pe tye atir, ka mare dit ikome, en dong myero otim kit macalo cwinye mito. Bal mo pe iye, gitwero nyome. <verse eid="1CO 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 7:37" />Ento ka laco mo cwinye tek kun pe tye gin mo ma diye, madong bene nongo otyeko mine kene me weko nyakonu ma pe onyome, nongo otimo ber kace twero loyo tame. <verse eid="1CO 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 7:38" />Kumeno ngat munyomo nyako ma otongo keny woko kwede nongo otimo ber, ento ngat ma pe onyomo nongo otimo ber makato.<verse eid="1CO 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 7:39" />Cik gengo dako ka pud cware tye kwo, ento ka cware dong oto woko, ci en bedo ki kare me nyome ki laco mo mukene ma cwinye mito, matye ikin jo pa Rwot keken. <verse eid="1CO 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 7:40" />Ci twero miyo dakonu cwinye bedo yom makato kace en obedo kitmeno ma pe dok onyome. Meno tama, atamo bene ni atye ki cwiny pa Lubanga.<verse eid="1CO 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Cam ma kityero bot jogi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 8:1" />Lok ma dok ikom cam ma kityero bot jogi. Wangeyo ni, “wan ducu watye ki ngec.” Kit ngec meno miyo dano giwake awaka, ento mar tego niye. <verse eid="1CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 8:2" />Dano matamo kekene ni engeyo gin mo, nongo pe ngeyo gin mo kit ma onongo myero onge kwede. <verse eid="1CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 8:3" />Ento ka ngat mo maro Lubanga, ci Lubanga bene ngeye.<verse eid="1CO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 8:4" />Dong lok ma dok ikom cam ma kityero bot jogi; wangeyo ni, “jok pe gin mo i lobo,” dok ni, “Lubanga mo mukene peke, kono en Lubanga aceli keken.” <verse eid="1CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 8:5" />Kadi bed tye gin mogo ma kilwongo ni lubanga i polo nyo i lobo, kit macalo tye lwak lubanga ki lwak rwodi mapol mapatpati, <verse eid="1CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 8:6" />ento ki tung botwa Lubanga tye acel, en Lubanga Won, ma jami ducu a ki bote, ma wan wabedo tye pire; dok bene tye Rwot acel keken, Yecu Kricito, mamiyo jami ducu bedo tye, wan bene wabedo tye pire.<verse eid="1CO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 8:7" />Kadi bed kumeno, jo mapol pe gitye ki ngec macalo meno. Jo mogo dong gungi woko i woro jogi nio wa ceng tin; gicamo cam ma kun nongo pud gitamo ni, “Man adada gin ma kityero bot jok;” pien tamgi matye i igi manyutu balgi botgi goro, miyo gitamoni gidoko keni woko pi cam meno. <verse eid="1CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 8:8" />Cam pe bimiyo Lubanga pwoyowa; pe wabibedo marac ka pe wacamo cam, pe bene wabibedo maber ka wacamo. <verse eid="1CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 8:9" />Ento wugwoke, wek twero ma wutye kwede pe odok gin mo mamiyo dano magoro poto i bal. <verse eid="1CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 8:10" />Pien ka dano mo ma tam ma i iye ma nyute bale pud goro, ce oneno ni in ma itye ki ngec ibedo kacam i ot jok, pe itamoni bimedo tekcwiny bote me camo ringo ma kityero bot jogi? <verse eid="1CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 8:11" />Pimeno dano ma niyene goroni, ma obedo omeru mayam Kricito oto pire, en bito pi ngeci! <verse eid="1CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 8:12" />Dong ka wubalo kit man bot utmegiwu ma niyegi goro, ka dok wubalo tamgi ma nyutu botgi balgi ma pud goro, nongo wubalo bot Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 8:13" />Pimeno, kacam aye miyo omera poto i bal, pe dong abicamo ringo matwal, wek pe amii omera opot i bal.<verse eid="1CO 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CO 9" />
  <para style="s1">Twero ki tic pa Lakwena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 9:1" />An pe atye agonya? An pe lakwena? Yam pe aneno Rwotwa Yecu Kricito? Wun pe adwogi me tica i Rwot? <verse eid="1CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 9:2" />Kadi bed jo mogo pe giye ni an lakwena, ento ki tung botwu an lakwena, pien wun ki komwu aye wubedo lanyut me kwenana i Rwot.<verse eid="1CO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 9:3" />Man aye pidona bot jo ma giroka ki peny. <verse eid="1CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 9:4" />Pe watye ki twero me nongo cam ki mat ma iwa mito? <verse eid="1CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 9:5" />Pe atye ki twero me tero dako ma Lakricitayo kacel kweda i wota, macalo lukwena mukene, ki omego pa Rwot, ki Kepa? <verse eid="1CO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 9:6" />Nyo wan ki Barnaba keken aye myero watii pi camwa pirwa kenwa? <verse eid="1CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 9:7" />Anga ma cito i mony, ci cako culu mucarane pire kene? Anga ma pito olok i potone ma pe camo nyig olok ma ocek iye? Lakwat mene ma pe mato cak ma a ikom lim ma en kwayo?<verse eid="1CO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 9:8" />Atye kaloko lok man ikit pa dano keken? Cik kono pe loko lok marom ki man? <verse eid="1CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Nwo 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1 Tem 5:18</ref></char></note> Pien i cik pa Moses kicoyo ni, “Pe itwe dog twon ka tye ka nyono bel.” Lubanga mono tame tye tutwal pi dyang? <verse eid="1CO 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 9:10" />En pe oloko lok meno pirwa? I adane loke yam kicoyo pirwa, pien lapur myero opur pur kun nongo tye ki gen, ngat ma dino bel bene myero odin kun tye ki gen me nongo dul mo iye. <verse eid="1CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:27">Rom 15:27</ref></char></note> Ka wacoyo kodi me cwiny ikinwu, meno loke bedo lok madit tutwal ka wakayo jami mogo me kom ki botwu? <verse eid="1CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 9:12" />Ka jo mukene gitye ki twero meno ikomwu, ci wan dong pe wakatogi kwede woko?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 9:12">Ento kadi bed twero meno tye botwa, pe watiyo kwede; wadiyo cwinywa i lok ducu wek pe omii waket ariya mo ma gengo tito lok me Kwena Maber ikom Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:1">Nwo 18:1</ref></char></note> Pe wungeyo ni, jo ma gitiyo tic i Ot pa Lubanga ginongo camgi ki i Ot pa Lubanga, dok jo ma gitiyo ikom keno tyer kipoko botgi gitum ma gityero? <verse eid="1CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 9:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk 10:7</ref></char></note> Rwot bene yam ociko ikit yo acelu ni, jo ma tito lok me Kwena Maber myero gunong gin ma gikwo kwede pi tito lok me Kwena Maberi.<verse eid="1CO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 9:15" />Ento an pe atiyo ki twero macalo meno wa ki acel. Dok bene pe acoyo lok man ni kono wutima kitmeno. Bedo ber ka ato, kato ma dano mo loko wakena doko gin ma ka cungone peke. <verse eid="1CO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 9:16" />An pe awake ka atito lok me Kwena Maber, pien meno obedo tica ma omyero atii. Ka pe atito lok me Kwena Maber, ci abineno can. <verse eid="1CO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 9:17" />Ka atimo man pi mitina pira kena, abinongo mot, ento ka atimo man kun pe tye pi mitina pira kena, nongo atye ka cobo tic ma kimiya. <verse eid="1CO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 9:18" />Abinongo kit mot ango? Mot ma mera en aye yomcwiny ma anongo itito lok me Kwena Maber, labongo ngolo kit cul mo iye bot dano ma giwinyo, kun bene pe atiyo ki twero ma atye kwede wek anong kony mo ki bot jo ma atito botgi lok me Kwena Maber.<verse eid="1CO 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 9:19" />Kadi bed alone kena inyim dano ducu, ento dong atyeko mine me bedo opii pa jo ducu, wek anong dano mapol. <verse eid="1CO 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 9:20" />Ka atye katic bot Lujudaya aloke abedo macalo Lujudaya, wek anong Lujudaya mogo; bot jo matye ite Cik pa Moses abedo bene macalo ngat matye ite Cik, kadi bed an ki koma pe atye ite Cik, wek anong jo matye ite Cik. <verse eid="1CO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 9:21" />Bot Lurok ma pe ite Cik pa Moses abedo macalo ngat ma pe ite Cik, kun nongo pe atye labongo Cik pa Lubanga, ento abedo ite Cik pa Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 9:22" />Bot jo ma gigoro i niyegi, aloke adoko dano magoro bene, wek anong jo magoro. Alubu kit ducu ma dano gitye kwede, wek omiya alar jo mogo i yo ducu. <verse eid="1CO 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 9:23" />Meno ducu atiyo pi lok me Kwena Maber, wek an bene anywak gum mo ma a iye kacel kwedgi.<verse eid="1CO 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 9:24" />Pe wungeyo ni, jo ma gipyem i ngwec ducu giringo, ento ngat acel keken aye ma limo mot me pwoc? Wun bene wuring kumeno wek wunong mot me pwoc. <verse eid="1CO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 9:25" />Dano acel acel ma pyem i tuku myero ogwoke kene i yo ducu. Kitimo meno wek gunong lalukana ma bale woko, ento wan watimo pi nongo lalukana ma pe bale. <verse eid="1CO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 9:26" />An mera aringo atir ma pe acabe atata; ka awaci atye i tuku me donge, pe adongo piny macalo ngat ma dongo yamo ata. <verse eid="1CO 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 9:27" />Acano koma, kun bene aloye calo opiina, wek ka dong atyeko tito lok bot jo mukene, pe abed ngat ma pe kipwoyo.<verse eid="1CO 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Woro Jogi kelo can</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: a </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 13:21">Nia 13:21</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:22">22</ref>; </char>
      <char style="xo" closed="false">b </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 14:22-29">Nia 14:22-29</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Utmegina, amito wunge ni, kwarowa ducu yam gubedo ite pol, gin ducu guwok ki i dye nam, <verse eid="1CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 10:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Nia 16:35</ref></char></note> gin ducu bene yam kibatijagi i ipol ki i nam, wek dong gubed jo pa Moses. <verse eid="1CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 10:3" />Gin ducu yam gucamo cam acel me cwiny, <verse eid="1CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 10:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:6">Nia 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 20:11">Wel 20:11</ref></char></note> gin ducu bene gumato ginamata acel me cwiny. Pien gumato pii ma oa ki ikom got me cwiny ma owoto kacel kwedgi, got meno yam en Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 10:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:29">Wel 14:29</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 14:30">30</ref></char></note> Kadi bed kumeno, Lubanga pe opwoyo pol jo mogo ma ikin gi; pimeno Lubanga oweko guto gutum woko liweng i tim.<verse eid="1CO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 11:4">Wel 11:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Lok meno ducu odoko labol botwa, ma cikowa ni pe myero wabed ka paro tiyo gin maracu kit ma gin yam guparo me tiyone. <verse eid="1CO 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:6">Nia 32:6</ref></char></note> Pe wawor jogi kit macalo jo mogo ikin gi gutimo. Kit mayam kicoyo ni, “Lwak gubedo piny gucamo ka gumato, ci gua malo ka myel.” <verse eid="1CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 10:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-18">Wel 25:1-18</ref></char></note> Wan pe myero wadonyu i timo tim kwele, macalo jo mogo ikin gi yam gutimo, ci jo alip pyeraryo wiye adek guto woko ducu inino acel. <verse eid="1CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:5">Wel 21:5</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 21:6">6</ref></char></note> Pe waomu cwiny Rwot, macalo jo mogo ikin gi yam guomo cwinye, ci omiyo twol onekogi woko. <verse eid="1CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 10:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:41-49">Wel 16:41-49</ref></char></note> Pe wabedo ka nguru, macalo jo mogo ikin gi yam gunguru kwede, ci omiyo Malaika ma laneko otyekogi woko. <verse eid="1CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 10:11" />Meno ducu yam otime ikomgi macalo lapowic, ka dong kicoyo me cikowa, wan jo ma agiki piny oo ikomwani. <verse eid="1CO 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 10:12" />Pimeno ngat mo matamo ni ecung matek myero ogwoke wek pe opoti. <verse eid="1CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 10:13" />Pe tye atematema mo ma makowu ma pe mako dano ducu; Lubanga gene, pe biye ni kitemowu matek makato ma wuromo cirone, ento ikare me atemowu, Lubanga, bimiyowu yo ma myero wubwot kwede, wek wubed ki twero me cirone.<verse eid="1CO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 10:14" />Pimeno, wun luwota ma amaro, wubol woro jogi woko matwal. <verse eid="1CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 10:15" />Aloko kwedwu macalo jo ma wigi tiyo; wun ki komwu aye omyero wutam matut i lok ma aloko. <verse eid="1CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 10:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:26-28">Mat 26:26-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-24">Mar 14:22-24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:19">Luk 22:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:20">20</ref></char></note> Kikopo me gum ma walego iye gum, pe waribe iye i remo pa Kricito? Mugati ma wan wabaro iyeni, pe waribe iye ikom pa Kricito? <verse eid="1CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 10:17" />Pien mugati tye acel, wan ma wapoli bene wabedo kom acel, pien wan ducu wanywako camo en mugati acelu. <verse eid="1CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 10:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 7:6">Lev 7:6</ref></char></note> Kong wunen jo Icrael; jo ma camo gitum ma kityero giribe katiyo tic i keno tyer bot Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 10:19" />Ka aloko kumeno nongo atamo ango? Ni cam ma kityero bot jogi obedo gin mo, nyo ni jogi gubedo gin mo? <verse eid="1CO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 10:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:17">Nwo 32:17</ref></char></note>Pe, gin ma awaco en ene ni, gitum ma jo ma pe ngeyo Lubanga gutyero, gityero bot jogi, ento pe gityero bot Lubanga. Pe amito wuribe ki jogi. <verse eid="1CO 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 10:21" />Pe wutwero mato ki i kikopo pa Rwot ki i pa jogi. Pe wutwero cam imeja pa Rwot ki dok imeja pa jogi. <verse eid="1CO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Nwo 32:21</ref></char></note> Wamito omo cwiny Rwot wek nyeko omake? Wan mono watye ki tek wakato en?<verse eid="1CO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Wutii gin ducu pi deyo pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 10:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 6:12">1 Kor 6:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Cik ye ni watim jami ducu,” ento meno pe nyutu ni jami ducu tye ki kony. “Atwero timo jami ducu,” ento man pe nyutu ni jami ducu weko niye pa dano dongo. <verse eid="1CO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 10:24" />Dano pe olub gin ma konyo en keken, ento myero olub gin ma konyo luwote bene. <verse eid="1CO 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 10:25" />Wucam kit ringo ducu ma kicato i cuk, labongo gungcwiny mo itamwu. <verse eid="1CO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 10:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:1">Jab 24:1</ref></char></note> Pien ginacoya tito ni lobo ki jami ducu matye iye obedo pa Rwot. <verse eid="1CO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 10:27" />Kace dano mo ma pe oye Lubanga olwongowu kacam, kun wumito wucit wucam, ka wuo i gange wucam gin ducu ma kiketo inyimwu, pe wubed ka penyo gin mo iye pi gungcwiny. <verse eid="1CO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 10:28" />Ento ka ngat mo owaco botwu ni, “Man gin madong kityero bot jok,” pe wucam, pi paro pi ngat madong otito lok meno pi poyo wiwu ni, ki pi tame ma i cwinye ma nyutu bale bote. <verse eid="1CO 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 10:29" />Meno aloko pi tam matye i cwiny dano mukene ca, pe pi tam ma icwinyi. Pingo kigengo kuc ma atye kwede me timo gin mo ni woko, pi tam matye i cwiny dano mukene? <verse eid="1CO 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 10:30" />Ka anywako camo cam ki jo mukene kun apwoyo Lubanga bene, pingo kicaya pi gin madong atyeko pwoyo Lubanga pire?<verse eid="1CO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 10:31" />Dong ka wucamo cam nyo ka wumato ginamata, nyo gin ducu ma wutiyo, wutim ducu pi miyo deyo bot Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 10:32" />Pe wubal cwiny Lujudaya, kadi jo Grik, nyo jo ma oye Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 10:33" />Kit macalo an atemo yomo cwiny jo ducu i gin ducu ma atiyo, kun pe alaro pi gin ma konyo an kena, ento alaro pi gin ma konyo jo mapol, wek gulare.<verse eid="1CO 10:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1 Kor 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Pili 3:17</ref></char>
    </note> Wulub kita, kit macalo an bene alubu kit pa Kricito.<verse eid="1CO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boyo wic ikare me woro Rwot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 11:2" />Apwoyowu pien ilok ducu wupo pira, kun wumako pwonya mayam akelo botwu. <verse eid="1CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 11:3" />Ento amito wunge ni wi laco acel acel en aye Kricito, wi dako aye cware, ki wi Kricito aye Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 11:4" />Laco moni ma lego Lubanga, nyo ma tucu lok me nebi kun oboyo wiye, meno nongo oketo lewic ikom Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 11:5" />Ento dako ma lego Lubanga nyo ma tucu lok me nebi, ma kun pe oboyo wiye nongo oketo lewic ikom cware, pien pe tye apokapoka mo ikin en ki dako ma olyelo wiye woko. <verse eid="1CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 11:6" />Ka dako mo pe boyo wiye, omyero onyar yer wiye woko. Kace bedo me lewic ka dako olyelo wiye, nyo onyaro yer wiye anyara, en dong omyero oboo wiye woko. <verse eid="1CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 11:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Aca 1:26</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 1:27">27</ref></char></note> Laco pe myero oboo wiye, pien en cal pa Lubanga dok deyo pa Lubanga bene; ento dako aye deyo pa laco. <verse eid="1CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 11:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:18-23">Aca 2:18-23</ref></char></note> Laco yam pe kicweyo nia ki ikom dako, ento dako aye oa ikom laco. <verse eid="1CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 11:9" />Laco yam pe kicweyo pi dako, ento dako aye kicweyo pi laco. <verse eid="1CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 11:10" />En ma omiyo dako myero obed ki lanyut me twero iwiye, pi lumalaika. <verse eid="1CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 11:11" />Ento i kwowa me bedo i Rwot, dako pe twero cung kene labongo laco, ki laco bene pe twero cung kene labongo dako. <verse eid="1CO 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 11:12" />Pien macalo dako yam kicweyo kun a ki ikom laco, ikit acelu laco bene dako aye ma nywalo, ento jami ducu a ki bot Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 11:13" />Kong wungol lok man kenwu; tika nen ber ka dako olego Lubanga ma pe oboyo wiye? <verse eid="1CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 11:14" />Kit ma kinywalowa kwede bene pe pwonyowu ni, ka laco oloto yer wiye odongo maboco, ci miyo ginyware? <verse eid="1CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 11:15" />Ento dako gire ka yer wiye olot maboco meno bedo me deyo bote, pien kimiye yer maboco nu me ume kwede. <verse eid="1CO 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 11:16" />Dong ka ngat mo mito kelo pyem iye, wan giwa wa peke ki kit tekwaro mo mapat ki man, pe bene tye ikin jo ducu muye Lubanga.<verse eid="1CO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cam me otyeno pa Rwotwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-29">Mat 26:26-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-25">Mar 14:22-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luk 22:14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 11:17" />Malube ki tam ma atye kamiyo botwu, atye ki lok mogo ma cwinya pe yom iye ikomwu, pien cokewuni gin mo ma konyo pe iye, ento tye ka kelo bal keken. <verse eid="1CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 11:18" />Lok mukwongo ma atyeko winyone en aye ni, ka lwak gucoke kacel, apokapoka bedo tye ikinwu. An bene ki tungcel aye lok meno, <verse eid="1CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 11:19" />pien apokapoka mogo myero obed ikinwu, wek jo matye maber gunen woko kamaleng. <verse eid="1CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 11:20" />Pien ka wucoke kacel pe wucamo Cam me otyeno pa Rwotwa aye. <verse eid="1CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 11:21" />Pien wun ducu ka wucamo, ngat acel acel kwongo camo came woko, kun jo mogo bedo ki kec, ki jo mogo gimer mere woko. <verse eid="1CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 11:22" />Wun mono paciwu peke, kama wutwero camo iye cam ki mato matgu? Nyo wucayo jo ducu muye Lubanga, kun wuketo lewic ikom jo ma pe tye ki gin mo? Myero awac botwu gin ango? Wumito ni apwowu? Pe atwero pwoyowu pi lok man.<verse eid="1CO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 11:23" />Pien pwony mayam apwonyowu kwede, Rwot aye mumiya, ni, i wor meno ma kiketo roro ikome ni, Rwot Yecu okwanyo mugati; <verse eid="1CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 11:24" />madong opwoyo, ci obaro iye, omiyogi kun waci, “Man aye koma matye pirwu. Wutim kit man me po kwede pira.” <verse eid="1CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:25: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Nia 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Jer 31:31-34</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:6-8">Nia 24:6-8</ref></char></note> Kitmeno ma gucamo otum, otingo kikopo kun waci, “Kikopo man aye gicike manyen i remona. Wutim kit man ikare ducu ma wumato, me po kwede pira.” <verse eid="1CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 11:26" />Pien ikare ducu ma wucamo mugati man, dok bene ka wumato ki i kikopo man, nongo wutye ka yweko lok me to pa Rwot, nio ka en bidwogo.<verse eid="1CO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 11:27" />En ma omiyo ka dano mo ocamo mugati man, nyo omato kikopo man ma kun kite pe myero, nongo en otimo bal ikom kom ki remo pa Rwot. <verse eid="1CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 11:28" />Dano acel acel myero kong okwong ngiine kene, ka dong ocak camo mugati meno ki mato ki i kikopo meno. <verse eid="1CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 11:29" />Pien ngat ma camo nyo mato kun pe oniang maber ikom gin ma kilwongo ni kom Rwot, nongo en tye ka kelo ngolo kop ikome kene kace ocamo nyo omato. <verse eid="1CO 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 11:30" />Meno gin ma omiyo jo mapol ikinwu gitwo, dok gigoro bene, ki jo mogo dong guto woko. <verse eid="1CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 11:31" />Ka kono nene wan ki komwa kong wangiine kekenwa ki ada, kono pe kingolo kop ikomwa. <verse eid="1CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 11:32" />Dong ka Rwot aye ma ongolo kop ikomwa, nongo en opwodowa me pwonyowa, wek pe kingol kop olowa kacel ki jo me lobo.<verse eid="1CO 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 11:33" />Pimeno dong, wutmegina, ka wucoke kacamo cam pa Rwotwa, ngat acel acel myero kong okur lawote. <verse eid="1CO 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 11:34" />Ka dano mo kec tye kaneko, omyero kong ocam cam i pacone, wek pe kingol kop ikomwu ka wucoke kacel. Lok mukene mudong, abicobo ka ao botwu.<verse eid="1CO 11:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Mot ma Cwiny Maleng miyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 12:1" />Utmegina, amito wuniang lok ikom mot ma Cwiny Maleng miyo. <verse eid="1CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 12:2" />Wungeyo ni ikare mayam onongo pud pe wungeyo Lubanga, onongo wurwenyo woko ata ka woro cal jogi ma pe loko. <verse eid="1CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 12:3" />Pimeno amito wuniang ni, pe tye ngat mo ma Cwiny pa Lubanga telo ma waci, “Kicen Yecu;” dok bene pe tye ngat mo matwero waci, “Yecu aye Rwot,” ento Cwiny Maleng keken matwero miyo en loko.<verse eid="1CO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 12:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:6-8">Rom 12:6-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Mot tye ma kitgi patpat, ento en Cwiny acelu aye miyogi. <verse eid="1CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 12:5" />Tic ma kitiyo pi Rwot bene tye ma kitgi patpat, ento Rwot acelu aye kitiyo pire. <verse eid="1CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 12:6" />Tye teko mapatpat me tiyo tic i yo mapatpat, ento Lubanga acelu aye mamiyo teko bot jo ducu. <verse eid="1CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 12:7" />Lubanga onyutu tye pa Cwiny Maleng bot dano ki acel acel pi konyo lwak. <verse eid="1CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 12:8" />Cwiny Maleng miyo bot dano acel kwena me ryeko; en Cwiny acelu bene miyo bot dano mukene kwena me ngec. <verse eid="1CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 12:9" />En Cwiny acelu miyo niye bot ngat mukene, ki bot dano mukene en Cwiny acelu miyo mot me cango two. <verse eid="1CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 12:10" />Bot ngat mukene en miyo mot me tiyo tango, bot ngat mukene mot me tito lok me tucu nebi, bot ngat mukene miyo ryeko me poko kin cwiny mapatpat, bot ngat mukene miyo dumu leb mapatpat, bot ngat mukene miyo ryeko me gonyo leb mapatpat. <verse eid="1CO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 12:11" />Ento Cwiny acelu aye ma tiyo tic i mot magi ducu; en poko mot mapatpat bot dano acel acel kit macalo en mito.<verse eid="1CO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kom acel tye iye dul mapol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 12:4">Rom 12:4</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 12:5">5</ref></char>
    </note> Pien Kricito obedo calo kom acel matye iye dul mapol; ento nongo pud tye kom acel, kadi bed gitye dul mapol. <verse eid="1CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 12:13" />Pien wan ducu, Lujudaya ki jo Grik, opii ki jo ma gilone ken gi, kibatijawa wadoko kom acel i Cwiny acelu pa Lubanga, wan ducu wamato en Cwiny acelu.<verse eid="1CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 12:14" />Pien kom dano pe tye iye dul acel keken, ento tye iye dul mapol. <verse eid="1CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 12:15" />Ka kono tyen waco ni, “Pien an pe a cing, an pe a dul kom,” meno pe genge bedo dul kom. <verse eid="1CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 12:16" />Ka kono it waco ni, “Pien an pe a wang, an pe a dul kom,” meno pe genge bedo dul kom. <verse eid="1CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 12:17" />Ka kono kom ducu obedo wang, kono ki winyo lok ki ngo? Dok kono kom ducu obedo it, kono kingweyo ki ngo? <verse eid="1CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 12:18" />Ento kit matye kwedeni, Lubanga oketo dul mapatpat ikom, dul acel acel kit macalo en mito. <verse eid="1CO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 12:19" />Ka kono gin ducu gubedo dul acel, kom kono obedo kwene? <verse eid="1CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 12:20" />Kit macalo tye ni, tye dul mapol, ento kom tye acel. <verse eid="1CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 12:21" />Wang pe twero waco ki cing ni, “An pe amiti.” Wic pe twero waco ki tyen ni, “An gira pe amitowu.” <verse eid="1CO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 12:22" />I ada, dul kom maca ma kitamo ni goro ni mite tutwal, <verse eid="1CO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 12:23" />dok bene dul maca me kom ma kitamo ni deyogi peke ni, dul magi aye kigwokogi ki deyo makato, ki dul komwa ma pe nen maberi aye warukugi ki ruk manen maber makato, <verse eid="1CO 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 12:24" />ma dul komwa ducu ma ginen maberi pe gimito. Lubanga kikome aye oketo dul mapol me kom kun ribogi kacel, kun miyo deyo madwong makato bot dul ma deyogi nok, <verse eid="1CO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 12:25" />wek apokapoka mo obed pe ikom, ento omii dul acel acel opar pi dul wadgi. <verse eid="1CO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 12:26" />Ka dul mo acel tye ki arem, ci dul kom mukene ni ducu bene rem kacel kwede; ka gipako dul acel, dul mukeneni ducu bene ribe kwede ki yomcwiny.<verse eid="1CO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 12:27" />Kombedi dong wun kom Kricito, dano acel acel ducu obedo dul kom Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 12:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:11">Epe 4:11</ref></char></note> Ento Lubanga oketo jo magi ikin lwak muye Kricito; mukwongo lukwena, me aryone lunebi, me adeke lupwony, ki dok jo ma tiyo tic me tango; ki jo ma lubu gin jo ma kimiyo botgi mot me cango two ki ikom dano, jo ma tiyo tic me kony, jo maromo loyo tic, ki jo ma gidumu leb mapatpat. <verse eid="1CO 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 12:29" />Jo ducu gin lukwena? Jo ducu gitye lunebi? Jo ducu gitye lupwony? Jo ducu gitimo tango? <verse eid="1CO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 12:30" />Jo ducu tye ki mot me cango dano? Jo ducu gidumu leb mapatpat? Jo ducu gin lugony leb? <verse eid="1CO 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 12:31" />Wuket cwinywu i nongo mot ma pirgi dito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 12:31">Kombedi dong amito anyut botwu yo maber dok makato.<verse eid="1CO 12:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Mar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 13:1" />Kadi aloko leb pa dano ki pa lumalaika, ka pe atye ki mar, abedo calo olang ma kok, gara ma woo awoya. <verse eid="1CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:21">21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mar 11:23</ref></char></note> Ka atye ki mot me tito lok pa Lubanga macalo lanebi, ma aniang i mung ducu, dok bene nongo atye ki ngec ducu, ma atye bene ki niye ducu, ma atwero bene kobo kwede godi madongo gu woko kamukene, ce pe atye ki mar, ci pe a gin mo. <verse eid="1CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 13:3" />Ka apoko jami ducu ma atye kwede, ma bene amiyo koma ni kiwang woko ki mac, ento ka pe atye ki mar, ci pe konya ki gin mo.<verse eid="1CO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 13:4" />Ngat matye ki mar diyo cwinye, dok lakica bene; pe lanyeko, pe wake; <verse eid="1CO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 13:5" />pe nyate, pe tiyo gin ma pe myero, pe yenyo gin mukemo en kene; pe bedo ki kec cwiny, pe bedo kun keto cwinye ikom gin marac ma kitimo ikome; <verse eid="1CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 13:6" />cwinye pe bedo yom ikom tim ma pe atir, ento cwinye bedo yom ilok ada. <verse eid="1CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 13:7" />Ngat matye ki mar diyo cwinye ikom jami ducu, ye lok ducu, dok bedo ki gen ikare ducu, keto tek bene me ciro jami ducu.<verse eid="1CO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 13:8" />Mar pe gik; ento lok me nebi bitum woko; kadi dumu leb bene bigik woko; kadi ngec bene bitum woko, <verse eid="1CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 13:9" />pien wan wangeyo dul mogo manoknok keken, dok bene watito lok me nebi i dul mogo manoknok keken; <verse eid="1CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 13:10" />ento ka gin ma pe orem bibino, ci gin ma orem bigik woko. <verse eid="1CO 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 13:11" />Ikare ma pud an latin, onongo aloko lok calo latin, aparo jami ducu calo latin; ento kombedi madong ategini, dong abwoto kit me tino woko. <verse eid="1CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 13:12" />Gin ma watye kaneno kombedi obedo calo cal manen yiriyiri ikio; ento ikare ma bino anyim ca wabinene wang ki wang. Kombedi angeyo dul mo manok keken, ento inino ma bibino anyim ca abibedo ki ngec ducu liweng, kit macalo Lubanga tye ki ngec ducu ikomani. <verse eid="1CO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 13:13" />Dong tye gin adek ma gibedo matwal: niye, gen, ki mar; ento gin ma pire dit ma katogi ducu en aye mar.<verse eid="1CO 13:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Dumu leb mapatpat ki tucu lok me nebi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 14:1" />Wuket mar aye obed tamwu mukwongo ma pire dit; wuket cwinywu bene me nongo mot ma Cwiny Maleng miyo, makato ducu mot me tito lok me nebi. <verse eid="1CO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 14:2" />Pien dano ma dumu leb mapatpat pe loko ki dano, ento nongo loko ki Lubanga. Ngat mo ma niang i loke pe, pien nongo en tye kaloko mung me Cwiny Maleng. <verse eid="1CO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 14:3" />Ento dano ma tucu lok me nebi loko ki dano kun tego niyegi, ci cuko cwinygi dok kweyo cwinygi bene. <verse eid="1CO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 14:4" />Dano ma dumu leb mapatpat tego niye ne kene; ento ngat ma tucu lok me nebi nongo tye ka tego jo ma oye Kricito i niyegi. <verse eid="1CO 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 14:5" />Amito ni wudum leb mapatpat, ento makato ducu amito wutit lok me nebi. Dano ma tucu lok me nebi pire dit kato ngat ma dumu leb mapatpat, nikwanyo kace tye ngat mo matwero gonyo telok ma en loko bot dano, wek okony jo ma oye Kricito wek gubed ma gutegi.<verse eid="1CO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 14:6" />Utmegina, ka abio botwu kunu ma kun nongo adumo leb mapatpat, abibedo ki kony ango botwu, ka pe akelo botwu lok pa Lubanga ma kinyuta, nyo ngec mo, nyo lok mo me nebi ma Lubanga omiya me atita, nyo pwony mo? <verse eid="1CO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 14:7" />Kadi wa gin ma pe ki kwo, ma kok calo nyamulere nyo nanga, kace dwone pe winye maber, ci dano gibiniang ningning i wer ma kikutu nyo kigoyo? <verse eid="1CO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 14:8" />Bila bene ka pe kikutu idwon me lwongo kikome, ci anga ma biyube pi cito ilweny? <verse eid="1CO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 14:9" />En i yo acelu, anga ma biniang i gin ma wuloko ka wudum aduma ki leb mapatpat, kun wuloko lok ma pe giniang tere? Lokwu biket woko i yamo ata. <verse eid="1CO 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 14:10" />Tye leb mapol ma kitgi patpat iwi lobo, ento pe tye mo ma teloke peke. <verse eid="1CO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 14:11" />Ento ka pe angeyo leb ma dano moni tye kaloko, abedo macalo larok bote, ki en bene bedo macalo larok bota. <verse eid="1CO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 14:12" />Dong wun bene; kit macalo wutyeko keto cwinywu me nongo mot me Cwiny, wuteme matek me tic ki gin ducu ma tego jo ma oye Kricito, wek gucung matek.<verse eid="1CO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 14:13" />Pimeno, dano ma dumu leb mapatpat myero oleg Lubanga wek okonye me gonyo tyen lok ma en loko. <verse eid="1CO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 14:14" />Pien ka alego Lubanga ma kun nongo adum aduma ileb mapat ma pe aniang tere, nongo cwinya aye lego, ento nongo pe medo ngec mo i niang ma mera. <verse eid="1CO 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 14:15" />Atim ango doki? Abilego Lubanga i cwiny dok bene abilego lega i ngec ki niang; abiwero wer i cwiny dok bene abiwero wer i ngec ki niang. <verse eid="1CO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 14:16" />Ka pe kumeno, ka ipwoyo Lubanga i cwiny keken, dano mukene ata ma obino icokewu twero gamo “Amen” ipwoci nu ningning, ma kun pe oniang i gin ma iloko? <verse eid="1CO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 14:17" />Kadi bed onongo imiyo pwoc maber, nongo pe ikonyo dano mukene ca me tegi kadi ki acel mo. <verse eid="1CO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 14:18" />Apwoyo Lubanga pien an adumu leb mapatpat ma akatowu ducu, <verse eid="1CO 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 14:19" />ento icoke pa jo ma oye Kricito amito loko lok abic mo keken ki ngec me niang wek apwony ki jo mukene, makato loko lok alip ki alip kun adum aduma ki leb mapatpat ma pe kiniang tere.<verse eid="1CO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 14:20" />Utmegina, pe wubed ki tam me tino, wubed lukere i timo gin marac, ento wubed jo muteggi i tamwu. <verse eid="1CO 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 14:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:11">Ica 28:11</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 28:12">12</ref></char></note> Yam kicoyo i cik ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">“Abilok ki jo me rok man</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">i leb pa jo ma dum ma pe ginang tere,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">ki i dog jo ma gin lurok ento kadi bed kumeno,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 14:21">ento gin pe gibiwinyo loka.”<verse eid="1CO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 14:22" />Meno nyutu ni, dumu leb mapatpat kimiyo wek obed lanyut bot jo ma pe guye Kricito, pe bot jo ma oye, ento tito lok me nebi tye pi jo ma oye, pe pi jo ma pe guye. <verse eid="1CO 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 14:23" />Dong ka dano ma guye Kricito gucoke kacel kun jo ducu ma iye gidumu leb mapatpat, dok ka jo mukene ata, nyo ma pe guye gubino i kacoke, pe gibiwaco ni wun jo ma obange? <verse eid="1CO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 14:24" />Ento ka dano ducu tye katucu lok me nebi, ce dano mo ma pe ye, nyo dano mo ata obino i kacoke, biniang ikom bale pi gin ma en owinyo ki bot jo ducu. Lok ma dano ducu guloko bingolo kop ikome, <verse eid="1CO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 14:25" />dok mung matye i cwinye bene en bitucu woko kamaleng, ka dong biryebe piny ci cako woro Lubanga kun tucu ni, “Adada, Lubanga gire tye ikinwu.”<verse eid="1CO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woro ma opore i Kanica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 14:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:19">Epe 5:19</ref> </char>
    </note>Utmegina, gin ango ma omyero dong kitim? Ka wucoke kacel, ma nongo ngat acel acel ikinwu tye ki gin mo; calo wer, nyo pwony, nyo ki lok ma kinyute, nyo ngat mukene ma dumu leb mapatpat, ki ngat mukene nongo ngeyo gonyo teloke; gin nu ducu omyero otime i yo makelo niang kun konyo tego jo ma oye Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 14:27" />Ka dano dumu leb mapatpat, myero gubed gin aryo nyo adek, pe okat wel enuni, kun gileyo aleya, ma ngat mo gonyo teloke. <verse eid="1CO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 14:28" />Dong ka onongo pe tye ngat mo ma gonyo, ci myero dano ma mito lok ileb mapatpat oling woko litik i coke pa jo ma oye Kricito, en olok kekene ki Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 14:29" />Ento jo aryo nyo adek ma gitucu lok me nebi gitwero lok, kun jo mukene ni ducu gingiyo lok ma gin loko. <verse eid="1CO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 14:30" />Kace inen Lubanga onyutu lok mo bot ngat mukene ma obedo piny, dong dano manen tye kalok ca myero oling woko. <verse eid="1CO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 14:31" />Pien wun ducu wutwero tito lok pa Lubanga kun wuleyo aleya, wek jo ducu gupwonye, dok bene ocuk cwinygi. <verse eid="1CO 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 14:32" />Jo ma gitucu lok me nebi gitye ki twero me loyo cwiny ma kimiyogi me tucu lok me nebi. <verse eid="1CO 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 14:33" />Pien Lubanga pe tice me kelo anyobanyoba, en gire won kuc.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CO 14:33">Macalo time i coke ducu pa lwak muye Yecu, ma gin jo pa Lubanga, <verse eid="1CO 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 14:34" />mon myero guling woko litik ka gitye i kacoke. Pien pe kiyegi me lok; gin myero gubed ite loc, macalo cik pa Lujudaya bene oloko. <verse eid="1CO 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 14:35" />Kace gimito ngeyo lok mo, myero gupeny coggi ki paco. Bedo me lewic mada, dako me lok i coke pa lwak dano ma guye Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 14:36" />Gwok nyo wutamo ni lok pa Lubanga yam oa ki botwu ba, dok obino botwu keken?<verse eid="1CO 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 14:37" />Ka ngat mo tamo ni en lanebi, nyo etye ki mot mogo me Cwiny, omyero onge ni lok ma acoyo botwu ni en aye cik ma oa ki bot Rwot. <verse eid="1CO 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 14:38" />Ento ka ngat mo pe oketo lok man itam, pe bene wuketo tamwu ikome. <verse eid="1CO 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 14:39" />Kitmeno, wutmegina, wuket cwinywu itucu lok me nebi, ento pe wugeng dumu leb mapatpat bene. <verse eid="1CO 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 14:40" />Ento wutim jami ducu i yo mupore, dok kore ki kore.<verse eid="1CO 14:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Cer pa Yecu Kricito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 15:1" />Utmegina, amito poyo wiwu ikom lok me Kwena Maber mayam atito botwu, madong wugamoni, en bene madong niyewu ocung iyeni. <verse eid="1CO 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 15:2" />En lok me Kwena Maber ma keliwu lar, kace wumako matek kit mayam atitiwu kwede, nikwanyo kace onongo wuye menono.<verse eid="1CO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 15:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:5-12">Ica 53:5-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pien yam akelo botwu lok ma pire dit mukwongo, en lok mayam kimiya, ma waco ni, Kricito yam oto pi balwa, kun lubu coc mayam kicoyo iginacoya; <verse eid="1CO 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-10">Jab 16:8-10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mat 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:24-32">Tic 2:24-32</ref></char></note> dok bene ni kiyike, ka dong kicere woko inino me adeke, kun lubu coc mayam kicoyo, <verse eid="1CO 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 15:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:34">Luk 24:34</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat 28:16</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14">Mar 16:14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36">Luk 24:36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19">Jon 20:19</ref></char></note> dok ni yam onen bot Petero, ka dok onen bot jo apar wiye aryo ca. <verse eid="1CO 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 15:6" />Ka dok onen bot utmego makato miya abic lawangacel; pol dano mogo ikom jonu pud gitye kwo, kadi bed jo mogo dong guto woko. <verse eid="1CO 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 15:7" />Ka dok onen bot Yakobo, lacene onen bot lukwena ducu. <verse eid="1CO 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:3-6">Tic 9:3-6</ref></char></note> Me agikine ducu, ci bene onen bota, kadi bed abedo calo latin ma kibwogo abwoga. <verse eid="1CO 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Tic 8:3</ref></char></note> Pien an aye dong pire pe dit matwal ki ikin lukwena ducu, ma onongo pe apore me alwonga ni an lakwena, pien yam aketo can ikom jo pa Lubanga muye Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 15:10" />Ento pi kica pa Lubanga omiyo atye kit macalo atye kede ni; kicane matye bota ni yam pe obedo me nonono. Piman yam abedo ka mede kitiyo tic matek tutwal makato jonu ducu; ento pe an aye ma atiyo, ento kica pa Lubanga aye ma otiyo kacel kweda. <verse eid="1CO 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 15:11" />Dong kadi bed onongo an nyo gin jonu, lok ma wan dong watito en enu, dok bene lok ma wun wuye ni en enu.<verse eid="1CO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cer pa jo ma oto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 15:12" />Dong kalok me kwenawa tito ni kicero Kricito ki ikin jo ma oto, pingo jo mogo ikinwu giwaco ni cer pa jo ma oto pe tye? <verse eid="1CO 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 15:13" />Kace cer pa jo ma oto pe, ci Kricito bene kara pe kicero. <verse eid="1CO 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 15:14" />Ka Kricito yam pe kicero, ci Kwena ma watito ni dong yo ne peke, kadi wa niyewu bene yo ne peke. <verse eid="1CO 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 15:15" />Medo ki meno, nongo wan bene lucaden me goba ikom Lubanga, pien waloko lok ikom Lubanga ni en ocero Kricito, ento ka dano pe kicero, ci yam Kricito bene pe kicere. <verse eid="1CO 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 15:16" />Pien ka cero jo ma oto peke, nongo Kricito bene yam pe kicero. <verse eid="1CO 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 15:17" />Ka Kricito yam pe kicero, ci kony me niyewu bene peke, nongo pud wutye ibalwu. <verse eid="1CO 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 15:18" />Man dong tyen loke ni, jo ma oto i Kricito nongo dong gurwenyo woko matwal. <verse eid="1CO 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 15:19" />Ka genwa ikom Kricito konyowa i kwo me kare ni keken, ci dong nongo watye marac makato jo ducu.<verse eid="1CO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 15:20" />Ento i adane, Kricito dong kicero woko ki ikin jo ma oto, en tye macalo wicam mukwongo cek ki ikin jo ma oto. <verse eid="1CO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 15:21" />Pien dano aye mukelo to, dok bene cer pa jo ma oto dano aye mukelo. <verse eid="1CO 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 15:22" />Pien macalo dano ducu to pi bal pa Adam, en ikit yo acelu jo ducu kibimiyogi kwo pi cer pa Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 15:23" />Ento ngat acel acel i kakare: mukwongo Kricito, ma en aye wicam mukwongo cek, ka lacene jo pa Kricito ikare me dwogone. <verse eid="1CO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 15:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 2:10">Kol 2:10</ref>,<ref loc="COL 2:15">15</ref></char></note> Ka dong agiki piny bio, ma Kricito bimiyo iye ker i cing Lubanga Won, ma nongo dong otyeko turu kit loc ki twero ki tek ducu me cwiny. <verse eid="1CO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CO 15:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Jab 110:1</ref></char></note> Pien en myero obed kaloc, nio ka Lubanga biketo lukwore ducu piny ite tyene. <verse eid="1CO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CO 15:26" />Lakwor ma kibityeko woko me agiki en aye to. <verse eid="1CO 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CO 15:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 8:6">Jab 8:6</ref></char></note> Pien yam kicoyo ni, “Lubanga oketo en obedo lalo jami ducu.” Ka kiwaco ni oketo “jami ducu ite loce,” nen kamaleng ni pe kikwano iye Lubanga kikome, ma oketo jami ducu ite loc pa Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CO 15:28" />Ka dong kityeko keto jami ducu ite loce, en Wod kikome bene kibiketo ite loc pa Lubanga, wek Lubanga dong ocok jami ducu ite loce.<verse eid="1CO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CO 15:29" />Eyo, ka jo ma oto pe gibicer, ci dong jo ma kibatija pi jo ma oto ni gibibedo ningning? Kace cero jo ma oto pe tye kadi ki acel, pingo kono dok kibatija pirgi? <verse eid="1CO 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CO 15:30" />Pingo wan kono wacung ka marac cawa ducu? <verse eid="1CO 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CO 15:31" />An mera akeme ki to nino ducu, wutmegina; meno awaco botwu atir, pi wake ma atye kwede ikomwu i Rwotwa Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CO 15:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:13">Ica 22:13</ref></char></note> Ka kono nene alwenyo ki lee mager i Epeco, macalo dano giwaconi, kono kit kony mene ma anongo iye? Ka cero jo ma oto pe, ci ber dong “wacamu, wamatu, pien diki wabito woko.” <verse eid="1CO 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CO 15:33" />Pe wuwek kibwolwu: “Bedo ki jo maracu balo kit mabeco.” <verse eid="1CO 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CO 15:34" />Wudwog cen itam ma atir, ci wugik bal woko cut. Pien jo mogo pe gitye ki ngec mo ikom Lubanga. Awaco man wek lewic omakwu.<verse eid="1CO 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kit kom ma dano bicer kwede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CO 15:35" />Gwok nyo ngat mo bipenyo ni, “Jo ma oto kicerogi ningning? Gibibedo ki kit kom macalo ningning?” <verse eid="1CO 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CO 15:36" />In lamingming! Kodi ma icoyo i potoni pe twero nongo kwo nio ka kong oto woko. <verse eid="1CO 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CO 15:37" />Gin ma icoyo ni obedo mere kodi nono, kadi bed kodi kal, nyo kit kodi mo keken, pe kom ginapita kikome ma bidongoni. <verse eid="1CO 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CO 15:38" />Ento Lubanga miyo kom ki kodi meno kit macalo yam en oyero, kodi acel acel ki kit kome mapat. <verse eid="1CO 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CO 15:39" />Ringo kom gin makwo ducu pe rom; ringo dano pat, ringo lee pat, me pa winyi pat, ki me pa rec bene pat. <verse eid="1CO 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CO 15:40" />Dok bene tye kom me polo ki kom me lobo; ento deyo pa kom me polo tye ki kite mapat, ki deyo pa kom me lobo bene tye ki kite mapat. <verse eid="1CO 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CO 15:41" />Ceng tye ki deyone, deyo pa dwe bene pat, ki lakalatwe gu bene gitye ki deyo mapatpat; pien lakalatwe bene kitgi patpat, omiyo deyo ma gitye kwede bene tye patpat.<verse eid="1CO 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CO 15:42" />Tye bene kitmeno ikom cer pa jo ma oto. Kodi ma kicoyo ni en gin ma top; ento ka dong kicero pe dok to. <verse eid="1CO 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CO 15:43" />Kicoyo ma nongo deyone peke, kicero ma nongo deyone tye; kicoyo ma nongo pud goro, ento kicero ma nongo dong tye ki tek. <verse eid="1CO 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CO 15:44" />Kicoyo ikom me lobo man, ci kicero ikom me cwiny. Ka kom me lobo man tye, ci kadi wa kom me cwiny bene tye. <verse eid="1CO 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CO 15:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Aca 2:7</ref></char></note> Yam kicoyo ni, “Dano mukwongo, Adam, odoko gin makwo”; ento Adam me agikine odoko cwiny mamiyo kwo. <verse eid="1CO 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CO 15:46" />Kom me cwiny aye pe kong kwongo bino, ento kom me lobo man, ka dong kom me cwiny bino lacen. <verse eid="1CO 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CO 15:47" />Dano mukwongo yam kicweyo nia ki i apwa me lobo, ento dano me aryone oa ki i polo. <verse eid="1CO 15:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CO 15:48" />Jo me lobo gical ki dano ma gia ki i apwa; kitmeno bene jo me polo gical ki dano ma a ki i polo. <verse eid="1CO 15:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CO 15:49" />Dong kit macalo waruku cal pa dano ma oa ki i apwa, kitmeno bene wabiruku cal pa dano ma oa ki i polo. <verse eid="1CO 15:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CO 15:50" />Man aye gin ma aloko botwu, wutmegina, ni, gin matye ki kom ki remo pe twero leyo ker pa Lubanga, gin ma top bene pe twero leyo gin mo ma pe top.<verse eid="1CO 15:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CO 15:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:51: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1 Tec 4:15-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Kong wuwiny mung man, ni, pe wan ducu wabito, ento wan ducu kibilokowa woko, <verse eid="1CO 15:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CO 15:52" />oyotoyot, pi kare manok mo keken, macalo wang ma tur limicmic, ka buriji me agiki bikok. Pien buriji bikok, ka dong kibicero jo ma oto woko kun pe dok gibito, wan bene kibilokowa woko. <verse eid="1CO 15:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CO 15:53" />Pien gin ma bale myero oruke ki gin ma pe bale, ki gin ma to myero oruke ki gin ma pe to. <verse eid="1CO 15:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CO 15:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:54: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 25:8">Ica 25:8</ref></char></note> Ka gin ma bale dong oruke ki gin ma pe bale, dok ka gin ma to dong oruke ki gin ma pe to, ka dong miyo lok mayam kicoyo obicobe kakare ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:54">“To dong kimwunyo woko, kiloyo woko matwal.<verse eid="1CO 15:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CO 15:55" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:55: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HOS 13:14">Koc 13:14</ref> </char>
    </note> In to, loci dong tye kwene?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CO 15:55">In to, kwir ni dong tye kwene?”<verse eid="1CO 15:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CO 15:56" />Kwir me to aye bal, dong tek me bal aye cik. <verse eid="1CO 15:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CO 15:57" />Ento myero wapwoyu Lubanga ma miyowa loc pi Rwotwa Yecu Kricito. <verse eid="1CO 15:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CO 15:58" />Pimeno, wutmegina ma amaro, wucung matek ma pe wuyenge, kun wumede bene ki tic pa Rwot nino ducu, kun wuniang ni, i Rwotwa yelewani pe me nono.<verse eid="1CO 15:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Jogo lim pi konyo jo pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CO 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 15:25">Rom 15:25</ref>,<ref loc="ROM 15:26">26</ref></char>
    </note> Dong lok ma mako jogo lim me konyo jo pa Lubanga, omyero wulub lok mayam aciko jo ma oye Kricito ma gibedo i Galatia ni gutim, wun bene wutim kumeno. <verse eid="1CO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CO 16:2" />Nino mukwongo i cabit ducu, dano acel acel ikinwu myero opok lim mo oket pat, malube ki kit ma en nongo kwede, ci okan woko, wek pe dok kijog limwu ki ikoma ka ao botwu. <verse eid="1CO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CO 16:3" />Ka ao botwu kunu, ci abicwalo jo ma wun wuyero me tero motwu i Jerucalem, kun nongo amiyogi bene waraga. <verse eid="1CO 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CO 16:4" />Kace onongo nen ni myero an bene aciti, ci wabicito kacel kwedgi.<verse eid="1CO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yub me wot pa Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CO 16:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:21">Tic 19:21</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Abio botwu kun nongo awok ki Makedonia, pien atamo me wok ki kunu. <verse eid="1CO 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CO 16:6" />Gwok nyo abibedo botwu pi kare manok mo, nyo bene abityeko kare me ngico piny woko ducu botwu, wek wukonya bene i dog wota ma abicito iye doki. <verse eid="1CO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CO 16:7" />Pien pe amito ni anenwu malmal, ageno abibedo botwu pi kare malac, ka Rwot oye. <verse eid="1CO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CO 16:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Lev 23:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Nwo 16:9-11</ref></char></note> Ento abibedo i Epeco nio wa inino me Pentekote<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr">16:8</char> <char style="fk">Pentekote </char> aye kare me kwero kayokac. </note>, <verse eid="1CO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CO 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:8-10">Aca 19:8-10</ref></char></note> pien dong giyabo yo bota malac me tiyo tic matek kany, dok jo ma gengo tic pol.<verse eid="1CO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CO 16:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:17">1 Kor 4:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Ka Temceo obino, wunen ni en obed ikinwu labongo lworo mo, pien en bene tiyo tic pa Rwot calo an ki koma. <verse eid="1CO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CO 16:11" />Ngat mo pe myero ocaye. Ento wukonye wek oruye wek odwog bota ki kuc, pien atye kakure kacel ki utmegiwa.<verse eid="1CO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CO 16:12" />Malube ki lok ikom ominwa Apolo, yam alege mada ni kong myero oo botwu, kacel ki utmego mukene, ento en pe omito bino kadi ki acel ikare man. Atamo dong en bibino kace onongo kare maber.<verse eid="1CO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lega me agiki ki mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CO 16:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 31:24">Jab 31:24</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:10">Epe 6:10</ref> </char>
    </note> Wuki piny, wucung matek liking ikom niyewu, wubed ki tekcwiny, wubed ki keru. <verse eid="1CO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CO 16:14" />Wunen ni gin ducu ma wutimo, otime ki mar.<verse eid="1CO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CO 16:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 1:16">1 Kor 1:16</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Utmegina, wungeyo ni Citepana ki jo ma i ode aye gin jo mukwongo doko Lukricitayo i lobo Akaya, dok bene gumine ken gi i tic pi jo pa Lubanga. <verse eid="1CO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CO 16:16" />Dong alegowu me bedo ki winy bot jonu, ki jo mukene ducu ma giyele kun gitiyo kacel kwedgi. <verse eid="1CO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CO 16:17" />Cwinya yom ibino pa Citepana gin ki Portunato ki Akaiko, pien gin gucung me kakarwu. <verse eid="1CO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CO 16:18" />Gin dong gukweyo cwinya, ki cwinywu bene. Gin jo macalo meno myero wutam pirgi.<verse eid="1CO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CO 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Tic 18:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Jo ma oye Kricito ducu ma gibedo i Acia gumotowu. Akwila ki Pricika gumotowu matek i Rwot, kacel ki lwak jo ma oye Kricito ma gicoke i otgi. <verse eid="1CO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CO 16:20" />Utmego ducu gumotowu. Wumote kekenwu ki mot maleng me mar.<verse eid="1CO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CO 16:21" />An Paulo, amotowu ki coc man ma acoyo ki cinga. <verse eid="1CO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CO 16:22" />Ngat ma pe maro Rwot myero kicen woko. Bin Rwotwa! <verse eid="1CO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CO 16:23" />Kica pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito obed kwedwu. <verse eid="1CO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CO 16:24" />Mar mera obed kwedwu ducu i Kricito Yecu. Amen.<verse eid="1CO 16:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CO 16" />
</usx>